OL,3,GNEWSATip closed after suspected
OL,4,Aexplosive found
OL,5,
OL,6,FA tip has been forced to close after a
OL,7,Fsuspected explosive device was found at
OL,8,Fthe site.
OL,10,FDorset Police said it was alerted to a
OL,11,Fsuspected ordnance device at Dorchester
OL,12,FHousehold Recycling Centre on St
OL,13,FGeorges Road just before 11:00 BST.
OL,15,FThe force said a cordon has been put in
OL,16,Fplace pending the arrival of Explosive
OL,17,FOrdnance Disposal experts.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
